---
---
<section class="section section--gray flowsec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Como funciona</span>
      <h2>Seu Imposto de Renda em 5 minutos.</h2>
      <p>Do extrato da corretora ao DARF pronto — você faz só 3 passos, a Sencon cuida do resto.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flow">
      <div class="flow__diagram" role="img" aria-label="Fluxo: Corretoras, Importação, Conferência, Cálculo automático e DARF">
        <div class="fnode fnode--origin">
          <span class="fnode__tag fnode__tag--neutral">Origem</span>
          <div class="fnode__ico">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 0l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.07 0l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fnode__body">
            <div class="fnode__t">Corretoras</div>
            <div class="fnode__d">B3 + Exterior</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frail__pulse" style="animation-delay: 0s;"></span></div>

        <div class="fnode">
          <span class="fnode__tag">Passo 01</span>
          <div class="fnode__ico">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fnode__body">
            <div class="fnode__t">Importação</div>
            <div class="fnode__d">Notas SINACOR / API</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frail__pulse" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;"></span></div>

        <div class="fnode">
          <span class="fnode__tag">Passo 02</span>
          <div class="fnode__ico">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><polyline points="9 12 11.5 14.5 16 9.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fnode__body">
            <div class="fnode__t">Conferência</div>
            <div class="fnode__d">Custódia × B3</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frail__pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s;"></span></div>

        <div class="fnode fnode--auto">
          <span class="fnode__tag fnode__tag--auto">Automático</span>
          <div class="fnode__ico">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" rx="1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fnode__body">
            <div class="fnode__t">Cálculo</div>
            <div class="fnode__d">Mês a mês, sem planilha</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="frail" aria-hidden="true"><span class="frail__pulse" style="animation-delay: 1.5s;"></span></div>

        <div class="fnode fnode--result">
          <span class="fnode__tag fnode__tag--green">Passo 03</span>
          <div class="fnode__ico">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 21V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v17l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-3 2z"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/><line x1="9" y1="12" x2="15" y2="12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="fnode__body">
            <div class="fnode__t">DARF</div>
            <div class="fnode__d">Pronto para pagar</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-steps">
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-step__num">01</div>
          <div>
            <div class="flow-step__t">Importe suas notas</div>
            <div class="flow-step__d">Envie suas notas SINACOR (.txt) ou conecte a corretora direto à plataforma.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-step__num">02</div>
          <div>
            <div class="flow-step__t">Faça a conferência</div>
            <div class="flow-step__d">Confira a custódia contra a B3, ajuste o que precisar e feche o mês tranquilo.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="flow-step__num">03</div>
          <div>
            <div class="flow-step__t">Emita seu DARF</div>
            <div class="flow-step__d">Clique em <b>"Emitir DARF"</b> — com juros e multa já calculados, se necessário.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-cta">
      <div class="steps-cta__txt">
        <div class="t">Quer que um especialista declare por você?</div>
        <div class="d">Conheça o Premium: um analista Sencon fecha seus meses e cuida da declaração anual de ponta a ponta.</div>
      </div>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn--whatsapp btn--lg" id="steps-premium-whatsapp-btn">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.5 14.4c-.3-.1-1.7-.8-2-.9-.3-.1-.5-.1-.7.1-.2.3-.7.9-.9 1.1-.2.2-.3.2-.6.1-.3-.1-1.2-.5-2.2-1.4-.8-.7-1.4-1.6-1.5-1.9-.2-.3 0-.4.1-.6.1-.1.3-.3.4-.5.1-.2.2-.3.3-.5.1-.2 0-.4 0-.5 0-.1-.7-1.6-.9-2.2-.2-.6-.5-.5-.7-.5h-.6c-.2 0-.5.1-.8.4s-1 1-1 2.4 1 2.8 1.2 3c.2.2 2.1 3.2 5.2 4.5.7.3 1.3.5 1.7.6.7.2 1.4.2 1.9.1.6-.1 1.7-.7 2-1.4.2-.7.2-1.2.2-1.4 0-.2-.3-.3-.6-.5zM12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12c0 1.8.5 3.5 1.3 5L2 22l5.2-1.4c1.4.8 3.1 1.2 4.8 1.2 5.5 0 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2z"/></svg>
        Seja Premium pelo WhatsApp
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('steps-premium-whatsapp-btn')?.addEventListener('click', function () {
    window.posthog?.capture('steps_premium_whatsapp_clicked');
  });
</script>
